        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Werner Herzog, Timothy Treadwell\n- Films: Grizzly Man, Pray the Devil Back to Hell\n- Places: Hallo Bay\n- Events: 2008 Tribeca Film Festival\n\nFacts:\n- In 2003, bear expert Timothy Treadwell died in an incident not far from Hallo Bay.\n- In 2005, Grizzly Man was released as an American documentary film directed by German director Werner Herzog.\n- In 2005, Werner Herzog's documentary film Grizzly Man focused on the life, work, and death of Timothy Treadwell.\n- In 2008, Pray the Devil Back to Hell premiered at the Tribeca Film Festival and won the award for Best Documentary there.",
